    {
      "name": "Fix Firebase after re-signing",
      "description": "Fixes Firebase services (push notifications, Remote Config, Firebase Auth) that break after Morphe re-signs the app with a different certificate.\n\nApply with Original app certificate patch — no other config needed.",
